-card primary\">\n<div class=\"feature-icon\">🎓</div>\n<h3>Learning Paths</h3>\n<p>Curated reading sequences from beginner to expert</p>\n<div class=\"feature-tags\">\n<span class=\"tag\">Beginner</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Advanced</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Specialized</span>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a href=\"must-read-papers.html\" class=\"feature-card\">\n<div class=\"feature-icon\">⭐</div>\n<h3>Must-Read Papers</h3>\n<p>Essential papers every researcher should know</p>\n<div class=\"feature-tags\">\n<span class=\"tag\">Curated</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Foundational</span>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a href=\"topics/ai-agents.html\" class=\"feature-card\">\n<div class=\"feature-icon\">🤖</div>\n<h3>Topic Deep Dives</h3>\n<p>Comprehensive guides for each research area</p>\n<div class=\"feature-tags\">\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agents</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">LLM Reasoning</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">RAG</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Multi-Modal</span>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"hub-section\">\n<div class=\"section-header\">\n<h2>📤 Export & Integration</h2>\n<span class=\"section-badge\">Workflow</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"section-desc\">Integrate with your existing research tools</p>\n<div class=\"feature-grid\">\n<a href=\"reading-list.html\" class=\"feature-card primary\">\n<div class=\"feature-icon\">📥</div>\n<h3>BibTeX Export</h3>\n<p>One-click export for Zotero, Mendeley, EndNote, LaTeX</p>\n<div class=\"feature-tags\">\n<span class=\"tag\">Zotero</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Mendeley</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">LaTeX</span>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a href=\"reading-list.html\" class=\"feature-card\">\n<div class=\"feature-icon\">📄</div>\n<h3>Markdown Export</h3>\n<p>Export notes and reading lists for Obsidian, Notion</p>\n<div class=\"feature-tags\">\n<span class=\"tag\">Obsidian</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Notion</span>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a href=\"rss.xml\" class=\"feature-card\">\n<div class=\"feature-icon\">📡</div>\n<h3>RSS Feed</h3>\n<p>Subscribe to paper updates in your feed reader</p>\n<div class=\"feature-tags\">\n<span class=\"tag\">Automated</span>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"quick-actions\">\n<h2>⚡ Quick Actions</h2>\n<div class=\"action-grid\">\n<button class=\"action-btn\" onclick=\"window.location.href='search-papers.html'\">\n<span class=\"action-icon\">🔍</span>\n<span>Search Papers</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"action-btn\" onclick=\"window.location.href='reading-list.html'\">\n<span class=\"action-icon\">📋</span>\n<span>My Reading List</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"action-btn\" onclick=\"window.location.href='notes.html'\">\n<span class=\"action-icon\">📝</span>\n<span>My Notes</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"action-btn\" onclick=\"window.location.href='wiki.html'\">\n<span class=\"action-icon\">📖</span>\n<span>Open Wiki</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"researcher-tips\">\n<h2>💡 Researcher Tips</h2>\n<div class=\"tips-grid\">\n<div class=\"tip-card\">\n<h4>🎯 Start with Learning Paths</h4>\n<p>New to a topic? Follow a structured learning path to build foundational knowledge before diving into papers.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tip-card\">\n<h4>📊 Track Your Progress</h4>\n<p>Use the reading list status system to track what you've read. Export your list regularly as backup.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tip-card\">\n<h4>🔗 Connect Concepts</h4>\n<p>Use the Concept Explorer to see how ideas from different areas (agents, reasoning, RAG) connect and influence each other.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tip-card\">\n<h4>📝 Take Structured Notes</h4>\n<p>For each paper, note: Key contribution, Methodology, Results, Limitations, and Questions for follow-up.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.role-hub {\n  max-width: 1400px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 20px;\n}\n\n.hub-hero {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 60px 20px;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n  color: white;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  margin-bottom: 40px;\n  bo